<template><section class="pg5-tokens"><div class="pg5-row"><h2>Design System</h2><Button size="sm" variant="text" @click="read">读取当前Token</Button></div><p>两列均为现有CSS变量的实际计算值；读取后立即恢复当前主题，不保存偏好。定义存在不等于组件合规。</p><section v-for="(names,group) in tokenGroups" :key="group"><h3>{{group}}</h3><div v-for="name in names" :key="name" class="pg5-token-row"><code>{{name}}</code><span>{{values.light[name]||'未定义'}} <small>Light</small></span><span>{{values.dark[name]||'未定义'}} <small>Dark</small></span><span class="pg5-token-swatch" :style="sample(group,name)">Aa</span><strong>{{values.light[name]&&values.dark[name]?'已定义':'FAIL'}}</strong></div></section><h3>Interaction / Accessibility / Responsive</h3><p>按钮32/38/44、普通字段44、Checkbox20的检测来自实际组件Inspector；不在此用预设数字伪造PASS。1440/1280/1024/390/375和200%属于真实浏览器验收范围。</p></section></template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref,onMounted} from 'vue'
import Button from '@/components/ui/Button.vue'
import {tokenGroups} from './registry'
const values=ref<{light:Record<string,string>;dark:Record<string,string>}>({light:{},dark:{}})
function read(){const root=document.documentElement,previous=root.getAttribute('data-theme');try{for(const theme of ['light','dark'] as const){root.dataset.theme=theme;const css=getComputedStyle(root);values.value[theme]=Object.fromEntries(Object.values(tokenGroups).flat().map(name=>[name,css.getPropertyValue(name).trim()]))}}finally{if(previous===null)root.removeAttribute('data-theme');else root.setAttribute('data-theme',previous)}}
function sample(group:string,name:string){if(group==='颜色')return{background:`var(${name})`};if(group==='字体')return name.startsWith('--font')?{fontFamily:`var(${name})`}:name.includes('-fs-')?{fontSize:`var(${name})`}:{};if(group==='圆角')return{borderRadius:`var(${name})`};if(group==='阴影')return{boxShadow:`var(${name})`};if(group==='间距')return{width:`var(${name})`};return{}}
onMounted(read)
</script>
<style scoped>.pg5-tokens{min-width:0;padding:var(--kf-space-4);background:var(--kf-card);border:1px solid var(--kf-border);border-radius:var(--kf-radius-lg)}.pg5-tokens h2{font-size:var(--kf-fs-h3);font-weight:var(--kf-fw-h3)}.pg5-tokens h3{font-size:var(--kf-fs-h4);font-weight:var(--kf-fw-h4);margin-block:var(--kf-space-6) var(--kf-space-2)}.pg5-token-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--kf-space-4);flex-wrap:wrap;padding-block:var(--kf-space-3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--kf-border)}.pg5-token-row code{font:var(--kf-fs-body-sm)/var(--kf-lh-body-sm) var(--font-mono);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.pg5-token-row small{color:var(--kf-muted-foreground)}.pg5-token-swatch{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-width:var(--kf-space-8);height:var(--kf-space-8);border:1px solid var(--kf-border);padding:var(--kf-space-1)}</style>
